---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber off
    actor Admin
    participant Page as Admin sites pages<br/>/admin/sites, /admin/sites/[id]<br/>PdfExportModal
    participant Api as API route<br/>/api/pdf
    participant Job as Background job<br/>processPdfJob, fetchReportData
    participant DB as Supabase DB<br/>S26_pdf_jobs, answers
    participant S3 as AWS S3

    Note over Admin,S3: Covers US 7.0.6 and 7.0.7. The PDF job flow and hidden questions (7.0.7) exist. The code has no fixed limit of 50 SIRs.<br/>"(proposed)" = the step is not in the code today.

    Admin->>Page: Select more than 50 SIRs (US 7.0.6).<br/>Per-SIR selection is only on /admin/sites/[id] (site mode)
    Admin->>Page: Clear questions to hide, one by one or a whole section (US 7.0.7)
    Page->>Page: Questions come from getQuestionsOnline(). A section is turned off<br/>only when all of its questions are cleared (selectedSections)
    Page->>Api: POST /api/pdf {mode: site or multi-site, siteNames,<br/>options: {selectedResponseIds, selectedSections, hiddenQuestionIds}}
    Api->>Api: Check app_metadata.role = admin and<br/>app_metadata.authenticated = true (exists)
    alt Caller is not Admin (7.0.6 AT 3, 7.0.7 AT 4)
        Api-->>Page: 403. No job is made
        Note over Admin,Api: A Steward who sends the same request directly is refused the same way
    else Caller is Admin
        Api->>Api: parseHiddenQuestionIds() drops ids that are not integers
        Api->>DB: Insert S26_pdf_jobs row, status pending.<br/>request_payload keeps the options
        Api-->>Page: 202 with jobId
        Api->>Job: after(): processPdfJob(jobId)
        loop Each batch of SIRs (proposed, batch size not decided)
            Job->>DB: Read answers and attachments (read only).<br/>Today fetchReportData loads all SIRs of the sites, then filters by selectedResponseIds
            Job->>Job: filterResponsesByOptions() removes answers of hiddenQuestionIds (7.0.7 AT 2)
            Job->>Job: Render pages. Same answers as the SIR page (7.0.6 AT 2)
        end
        alt Render or upload fails
            Job->>DB: Set job failed with error
            Page-->>Admin: Admin opens Recent Exports (PdfExportsDropdown) and sees Failed.<br/>PdfJobWatcher ignores failed jobs
            Note over Job,S3: The job only reads SIRs, so the stored reports stay unchanged (7.0.6 AT 4, 7.0.7 AT 3).
        else All batches done
            Job->>S3: Put the export file
            Job->>DB: Set job complete with storage_path
            Page->>DB: PdfJobWatcher polls S26_pdf_jobs every 3 s
            DB-->>Page: Job is complete
            Page->>Api: GET /api/pdf/status/{jobId}
            Api->>DB: Read S26_pdf_jobs status and storage_path.<br/>RLS returns the row only to the job creator (exists in local schema)
            alt Caller is not the job creator
                DB-->>Api: No row
                Api-->>Page: 404 Job not found. No URL
                Note over Api,DB: An Admin who did not create the job also gets 404.<br/>Letting Admins read other users' jobs is proposed
            else Caller is the job creator
                DB-->>Api: storage_path
                Api-->>Page: Presigned download URL
                Page-->>Admin: Export has each selected SIR (7.0.6 AT 1).<br/>With no hidden questions it has the full SIR (7.0.7 AT 5)
            end
        end
    end

    Note over Admin,S3: Open questions: the cause of the 50 SIR limit (the time limit of after(), memory,<br/>or the size of the request), and one PDF or a zip of several PDFs.<br/>Decided in code: hidden fields are per question, with a toggle for each section.
